N b1x2.pkg
D 30 Apr 2026
U 20
d 'B1X2': module to account for changes when X2 is added to a base model with X1
d 
d  b1x2 runs a "base" regression, runs a "full" regression with an
d additional regressor, and computes both the difference in the
d coefficent estimates for x1all     (including the constant) and a
d consistent estimate of the  asymptotic covariance matrix for
d this difference.
d 
d KW: regression
d KW: variance accounting
d 
d Requires: Stata version 10
d 
d Distribution-Date: 20140330
d 
d Author: Jonah Gelbach, University of Arizona
d Support: email gelbach@@gmail.com
d 
